The earlier solution was incorrect: it miscounted \(4,3,3,1,1\) and wrongly excluded \(2,2,3,3,1\).

The six possible digit multisets have \(20, 30, 20, 60, 30,\) and \(30\) arrangements, respectively. Their total is **190**, which is not among the listed options.

